{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A class which wraps all ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of toast"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"toast","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" objects like ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSToast","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllToastComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeToastComponentTokensProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ToastComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"toast"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Toast"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of borders ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dimensions ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":") and sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeToastComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define your own provider for toast component tokens","    \/\/ by inheriting from existing provider","    class CustomToastComponentTokensProvider: OrangeThemeToastComponentTokensProvider {","","        \/\/ Then override the toast component tokens you want.","","        override var sizeAssetSmall: SizeSemanticToken { DimensionRawTokens._100 }","","        override var borderRadiusMedia: BorderRadiusSemanticToken { BorderRawTokens.borderRadius0 }","","        \/\/ ...","    }","","    \/\/ Or define your own provider from scratch","    class CustomToastComponentTokensProvider: ToastComponentTokens {","","        \/\/ And implement hundreds of tokens.","        \/\/ You are allowed to give semantic tokens providers if you want to define values.","    }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Then, you can give this ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomToastComponentTokensProvider"},{"text":" to your own theme implementation:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class LocalTheme: OrangeTheme {","","    override init() {","        super.init(toast: CustomToastComponentTokensProvider())","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"or to an already existing theme for example:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    OrangeTheme(toast: CustomToastComponentTokensProvider())"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It is also possible to use your own semantic tokens providers for this component tokens providers:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    \/\/ Uses by default here:","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider for borders","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeDimensionSemanticTokensProvider for dimensions","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeSizeSemanticTokensProvider for sizes","    let toastComponentTokensProvider = OrangeThemeToastComponentTokensProvider()","","    \/\/ Or use your own border, dimension and size semantic tokens providers","    let toastComponentTokensProvider = OrangeThemeToastComponentTokensProvider(","                    borders: CustomBorderSemanticTokensProvider(),","                    dimensions: CustomDimensionSemanticTokensProvider(),","                    sizes: CustomSizeSemanticTokensProvider())"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}],"type":"aside"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeToastComponentTokensProvider","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllToastComponentTokensProvider","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensComponent\/documentation\/OUDSTokensComponent\/ToastComponentTokens","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/TokensProvider"]}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"